in Los Angeles for?

00:04:05.072 --> 00:04:07.620
How can I figure out a
way to live here forever?

00:04:07.620 --> 00:04:08.855
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:04:08.855 --> 00:04:09.688
- Because there's
something about, I think,

00:04:09.688 --> 00:04:13.440
just getting back to
the basics of, I mean,

00:04:13.440 --> 00:04:14.910
when we first started, we had nothing.

00:04:14.910 --> 00:04:16.470
I had a little cabin in the woods

00:04:16.470 --> 00:04:18.390
with no electricity, no water.

00:04:18.390 --> 00:04:19.223
- Yeah.

00:04:19.223 --> 00:04:20.970
- And we sort of, over
time, have now built it

00:04:20.970 --> 00:04:23.941
into this beautiful
little place that we just

00:04:23.941 --> 00:04:24.774
- Spot you go to, yeah.

00:04:24.774 --> 00:04:25.800
- Love going to.

00:04:25.800 --> 00:04:28.050
And I do things there
that I never do here.

