00:04:36.660 --> 00:04:37.740
I'm shoveling dirt,

00:04:37.740 --> 00:04:38.850
I'm taking out stumps.
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:04:38.850 --> 00:04:40.770
I mean, for whatever reason.

00:04:40.770 --> 00:04:41.790
- Yeah, yeah, yeah.
(audience applauds)

00:04:41.790 --> 00:04:42.900
- Thank you.
- All right.

00:04:42.900 --> 00:04:44.820
- But for whatever reason, when I'm here.

00:04:44.820 --> 00:04:46.620
- Moving dirt really gets her going.

00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:49.448
It's like amazing. (laughs)
(audience laughing)

00:04:49.448 --> 00:04:50.281
- When I'm here, I have no,

00:04:50.281 --> 00:04:52.047
I have no motivation
to do it when I'm here.

00:04:52.047 --> 00:04:52.930
- No, because you're busy here.

00:04:52.930 --> 00:04:54.907
- [Josh] Yeah.
- We work so much here.

00:04:54.907 --> 00:04:56.665
- [Josh] I guess.
- But whenever I'm there I do.

00:04:56.665 --> 00:04:57.498
I love getting on.

00:04:57.498 --> 00:04:58.331
- I have a zero turn lawn mower.

00:04:58.331 --> 00:04:59.164
- [Josh] You have a tractor too?

00:04:59.164 --> 00:05:01.950
Yes. But my zero turn is my
favorite thing to get on.

00:05:01.950 --> 00:05:04.620
I will, I'll literally,
I'll keep coming by my

00:05:04.620 --> 00:05:06.420
