00:05:06.420 --> 00:05:07.253
I'm almost done.

00:05:07.253 --> 00:05:08.086
No, I'm not.

00:05:08.086 --> 00:05:08.919
- Two hours later.

00:05:08.919 --> 00:05:10.420
- Two hours later. Yeah. I love it.

00:05:10.420 --> 00:05:12.270
- Yeah.
- Yeah. I love all of it.

00:05:12.270 --> 00:05:14.070
- There's something
cathartic about getting on

00:05:14.070 --> 00:05:17.610
