00:05:22.036 --> 00:05:22.869
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:05:22.869 --> 00:05:23.702
- And then once I had
my Bobcat, I was like.

00:05:23.702 --> 00:05:24.827
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:05:24.827 --> 00:05:25.890
- I was like getting real work done.

00:05:25.890 --> 00:05:28.230
- So you spend some time at
the cabin with your dad, right?

00:05:28.230 --> 00:05:30.600
- Yeah, my dad's the
reason I have the place

00:05:30.600 --> 00:05:31.560
he found the property

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:34.503
for me back in, I don't
know, 15 years ago.

00:05:34.503 --> 00:05:35.877
- Oh, that's cool.

00:05:35.877 --> 00:05:36.870
- And I never had a boat.

00:05:36.870 --> 00:05:38.250
I never grew up on a lake or anything.

00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:40.920
So it was, it's like a
full learning curve for me.

00:05:40.920 --> 00:05:42.000
- [Kelly] Yeah.

