sometimes not so much.

00:05:56.550 --> 00:05:58.830
The boat, we tried it on the water.

00:05:58.830 --> 00:06:00.150
It starts right up.

00:06:00.150 --> 00:06:01.800
I'm like, it was like a celebration.

00:06:01.800 --> 00:06:03.000
