00:06:54.960 --> 00:06:55.793
- [Josh] Oh, thank you, thank you.

00:06:55.793 --> 00:06:56.626
- Yeah

00:06:56.626 --> 00:06:57.459
- [Josh] Yeah, it's-
- I love the movies.

00:06:57.459 --> 00:06:58.517
- Yeah, me too.

