- Well it's just you're using
all these muscles you're

00:07:33.450 --> 00:07:34.740
not used to using.
- Yeah.

00:07:34.740 --> 00:07:36.900
- And you're trying so hard
to make them look like yeah

00:07:36.900 --> 00:07:38.880
I could pretend to be a pro.

00:07:38.880 --> 00:07:40.500
It wasn't, it wasn't,

00:07:40.500 --> 00:07:42.390
It took me a good three weeks to get

00:07:42.390 --> 00:07:43.650
comfortable.
- [Kelly] Oh man.

00:07:43.650 --> 00:07:47.370
But yeah, the show has been
such a pleasant surprise

00:07:47.370 --> 00:07:49.890
because I mostly took
the job in the beginning

00:07:49.890 --> 00:07:50.970
because I wanted to be home.

00:07:50.970 --> 00:07:52.260
I wanted to be able to
take my kid to school-

00:07:52.260 --> 00:07:53.198
- Yeah, me too.

00:07:53.198 --> 00:07:54.031
- And sleep in my own bed.

00:07:54.031 --> 00:07:56.040
I was gone so much the year before

00:07:56.040 --> 00:07:57.930
and I loved Lauren Graham.

00:07:57.930 --> 00:07:58.950
I love the Mighty Ducks.

00:07:58.950 --> 00:08:00.030
So I was like, you know what, let's do it.

00:08:00.030 --> 00:08:00.863
This will be fun.

00:08:00.863 --> 00:08:03.150
And I turned out to have the best time.

00:08:03.150 --> 00:08:03.983
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:08:03.983 --> 00:08:05.516
- Cause these kids are awesome.

00:08:05.516 --> 00:08:06.551
- [Kelly] It's a great cast.

00:08:06.551 --> 00:08:08.070
- Like, they're really sweet.

00:08:08.070 --> 00:08:09.330
They're unaffected.

00:08:09.330 --> 00:08:11.460
They're well adjusted.

00:08:11.460 --> 00:08:12.293
They work hard.

00:08:12.293 --> 00:08:13.620
They're talented.
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:08:13.620 --> 00:08:14.620
- And they have fun.

00:08:15.684 --> 00:08:17.220
- Yeah, I imagine it's
fun working with the kids.

00:08:17.220 --> 00:08:19.680
Did I hear that they were like off camera,

00:08:19.680 --> 00:08:22.320
like were they rapping or
something and you involved?

00:08:22.320 --> 00:08:27.090
- So, Max Simkins and
a few of the other ones

00:08:27.090 --> 00:08:32.090
are really, really good
musicians and it's singers.

00:08:32.351 --> 00:08:33.630
- [Kelly] That's cool.

00:08:33.630 --> 00:08:36.450
Yeah, Luke is an amazing singer

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:37.770
and DJ is this,

00:08:37.770 --> 00:08:40.440
he can take two pens and
make any beat you want.

00:08:40.440 --> 00:08:45.270
And so these kids in between
setups started doing this.

00:08:45.270 --> 00:08:49.350
I was like, what is he freestyle
raps, DJ's doing the beat.

00:08:49.350 --> 00:08:50.460
There's Luke on the thing.

00:08:50.460 --> 00:08:52.320
And they all just sort of like,

00:08:52.320 --> 00:08:55.110
Oh, so when I directed
my episode, episode seven

00:08:55.110 --> 00:08:56.310
which will be coming up soon.

00:08:56.310 --> 00:08:57.143
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:08:57.143 --> 00:09:00.270
- I asked them, "Have you guys
ever done this on camera?"

00:09:00.270 --> 00:09:01.260
And they said, "No."

00:09:01.260 --> 00:09:04.110
And I said, "Let me talk to the bosses

00:09:04.110 --> 00:09:04.943
and see if they'll let me do it."

00:09:04.943 --> 00:09:05.776
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:09:05.776 --> 00:09:06.945
So they yeah, they let me,

00:09:06.945 --> 00:09:09.930
I asked them to go make
a rap based on the story

00:09:09.930 --> 00:09:12.720
that we were telling
and it's in the episode

00:09:12.720 --> 00:09:13.577
and they just crushed it.

00:09:13.577 --> 00:09:15.510
- [Kelly] I love that.
- They crushed it.

00:09:15.510 --> 00:09:16.860
It wasn't even part of this episode.

00:09:16.860 --> 00:09:18.534
And these kids are just so talented.

00:09:18.534 --> 00:09:19.367
(audience applauding)

00:09:19.367 --> 00:09:21.270
- What I love most about that too

00:09:21.270 --> 00:09:23.010
is you're giving them an experience

00:09:23.010 --> 00:09:25.230
that sometimes I hear from
actors doesn't happen.

00:09:25.230 --> 00:09:27.540
You know, having freedom and
like implementing your ideas

00:09:27.540 --> 00:09:29.340
or like being inspired in the moment.

00:09:29.340 --> 00:09:31.080
Like sometimes there's not that freedom.

00:09:31.080 --> 00:09:32.850
That's a really cool
thing for them to know

00:09:32.850 --> 00:09:35.040
that that can happen at such
a young age in this industry.

00:09:35.040 --> 00:09:35.910
- Yeah, I think so.

00:09:35.910 --> 00:09:38.250
I mean and for me that's part of the fun.

00:09:38.250 --> 00:09:40.290
That's the reason why we do this is to-

00:09:40.290 --> 00:09:41.599
- [Kelly] Be inspired by each other.

00:09:41.599 --> 00:09:43.980
- And do what you're good at.

00:09:43.980 --> 00:09:45.180
They're obviously all good actors,

00:09:45.180 --> 00:09:46.620
but they're really good musicians too.

00:09:46.620 --> 00:09:47.563
I was like-
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:09:47.563 --> 00:09:49.380
- Let's find a way to
make it work for the show.

00:09:49.380 --> 00:09:50.213
And they killed it.

00:09:50.213 --> 00:09:52.260
- It's a different kind of
depth too for the characters.

00:09:52.260 --> 00:09:53.093
I like that.

00:09:53.093 --> 00:09:54.840
So you have some other
fun projects out now.

00:09:54.840 --> 00:09:56.100
Can you tell us about them?

00:09:56.100 --> 00:09:59.190
- I also have a movie out,
two movies, one called Bandit.

00:09:59.190 --> 00:10:01.140
Which is based on this,

00:10:01.140 --> 00:10:03.630
it's a true story about
this this bank robber Galvin

00:10:03.630 --> 00:10:07.413
or Gilbert Galvan who robbed
59 banks in the eighties.

00:10:07.413 --> 00:10:08.246
- [Kelly] Whoa.

00:10:08.246 --> 00:10:09.079
He was good at it.

00:10:09.079 --> 00:10:10.830
- It's one of my favorite
movies I've ever done

00:10:10.830 --> 00:10:13.710
because I got to, he was notorious

00:10:13.710 --> 00:10:15.840
for having all these crazy
disguises when you go in.

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:16.673
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:10:16.673 --> 00:10:18.480
- And was able to get
out of them very quickly.

00:10:18.480 --> 00:10:19.350
So that's out now.

00:10:19.350 --> 00:10:21.690
And there's a movie
called Blackout on Netflix

00:10:21.690 --> 00:10:23.160
which is also doing really well.

00:10:23.160 --> 00:10:23.993
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:10:23.993 --> 00:10:25.540
- I just wanted to say check it out.

00:10:25.540 --> 00:10:26.580
(audience cheering)
- I love that.

00:10:26.580 --> 00:10:28.020
Well, you have a lot of things happening.

00:10:28.020 --> 00:10:29.550
That's a lot of things all at once.

00:10:29.550 --> 00:10:30.383
- Yeah.

00:10:30.383 --> 00:10:31.860
Well, The Mighty Ducks:
Game Changer Season two

00:10:31.860 --> 00:10:32.693
is on Disney Plus.

00:10:32.693 --> 00:10:33.970
Y'all have to go watch it.

